WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:27.758
Ringo packed his bag.

2
00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:31.468
"Enjoy your cruise, Ringo," Bot said.

3
00:00:31.469 --> 00:00:33.836
"Get some rest."

4
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:46.956
Ringo smiled. "I will!"

5
00:00:46.957 --> 00:01:01.020
Ringo went on the cruise spaceship.

6
00:01:01.021 --> 00:01:08.950
It took off from the spaceport.

7
00:01:08.951 --> 00:01:18.506
Later Ringo went up to the deck.

8
00:01:18.507 --> 00:01:24.027
The spaceship was run by robots.

9
00:01:24.028 --> 00:01:29.429
They served food and drinks.

10
00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.739
A robot gave Ringo a drink.

11
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:40.168
"Thank you!" Ringo said. "Yum!"

12
00:01:40.169 --> 00:01:43.325
A big screen lit up.

13
00:01:43.326 --> 00:01:48.149
"Hello, passengers!" the robot pilot said.

14
00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.110
"We will soon get to Glitter Planet.

15
00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:55.909
Enjoy the beautiful glitter clouds!"

16
00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:58.524
The screen turned off.

17
00:01:58.525 --> 00:02:02.275
"I've never heard of that planet," Ringo said.

18
00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:06.057
"This is our first cruise there," a robot said.

19
00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:08.971
"The planet was just discovered."

20
00:02:08.972 --> 00:02:13.543
"That's exciting," Ringo said.

21
00:02:13.544 --> 00:02:17.763
"The planet has big clouds," the robot said.

22
00:02:17.764 --> 00:02:20.971
"They are made of colorful glitter."

23
00:02:20.972 --> 00:02:29.069
Ringo smiled. "I can't wait to see them!"

24
00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:32.412
Ringo walked along the deck.

25
00:02:32.413 --> 00:02:36.712
"No missions, no Lucy," he thought.

26
00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:41.917
"I'm going to have a great vacation!"

27
00:02:41.918 --> 00:02:44.853
Ringo went around a corner.

28
00:02:44.854 --> 00:02:50.225
Someone ran into him. Bam!

29
00:02:50.226 --> 00:02:53.455
"Oof!" Ringo dropped his drink.

30
00:02:53.456 --> 00:02:56.866
"Watch out!" a voice said.

31
00:02:56.867 --> 00:03:01.922
It was Lucy.

